00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:20.810
- Sure, OK. So

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:24.720
I've been with the Oregon
Health Authority since January

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.685
of 2020 in this role.

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:30.030
I work with a team that

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:35.100
