idea of having sort of like a

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:20.480
mentor network, right,

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:23.810
where I know of a few folks
who are working on some things that

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:24.980
I'm trying to learn,

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:28.130
and also I can share back
with folks who are trying to learn

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:29.555
some of the things
that I'm working on.

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:34.175
And we've talked about maybe
ways to do something like that

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.190
with the group as well.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:38.600
Really,

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:42.440
it's about fostering
connections and creating a

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:47.000
culture of inclusivity, where
everyone can do data science.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:51.860
Anyone here who's working
