I'm learning XML, and HL7,

00:23:02.100 --> 00:23:06.825
and some of these other ways
of moving data between systems that--

00:23:08.895 --> 00:23:10.800
it's definitely not where
I thought I was headed,

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:12.918
but it's super-exciting.
