00:28:45.735 --> 00:28:46.425
you know,

00:28:46.425 --> 00:28:50.490
a lot of folks decided to
move to smaller towns because the

00:28:50.490 --> 00:28:53.070
cost of living
and inflation just

00:28:53.850 --> 00:28:56.970
