a lot of progress

00:28:58.080 --> 00:29:00.270
from folks in public--

00:29:00.270 --> 00:29:02.355
in public sector pay

00:29:03.060 --> 00:29:04.535
in the last couple of years. So

00:29:07.230 --> 00:29:09.630
I don't really have a
good answer for that.

00:29:09.630 --> 00:29:13.350
The only thing I will say is
in terms of what we can do for

00:29:13.350 --> 00:29:14.385
each other on a team

00:29:15.840 --> 00:29:16.785
is that--

00:29:18.660 --> 00:29:20.950
is creating the culture that

00:29:21.630 --> 00:29:24.000
keeps people engaged and that

00:29:25.180 --> 00:29:27.710
makes people feel like
they're a part of something

00:29:28.510 --> 00:29:31.030
