at the national level to the

00:50:54.190 --> 00:50:55.825
trauma record. And so

00:50:57.340 --> 00:50:59.810
there's an effort now
within the data standards

00:51:00.550 --> 00:51:02.845
to be able to link these
at a national level.

00:51:04.690 --> 00:51:06.083
That work is ongoing.

00:51:07.120 --> 00:51:08.200
Oregon was, I think,

00:51:08.200 --> 00:51:11.650
